\tag{fnip}
\title{The Andronov–Hopf bifurcation}
\date{2026-11-27}

\p{The equilibrium of the Hopf column changes stability at two
values of the applied current. A periodic orbit branches from
the equilibrium at each value.}

\p{On which side of the parameter is that orbit, and is the orbit
stable?}

